    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CastleMiner Z: Resurrection</strong><br>The cult hit returns, rebuilt from the ground up in Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CastleMiner Z: Resurrection</i> is the ultimate open-world sandbox survival shooter. Explore vast, procedurally generated worlds \u2014 from scorched deserts to frozen wastelands \u2014 as you mine, craft, build, and fight for your life against relentless undead and fire-breathing dragons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than a remaster. We've reimagined every biome, weapon, and enemy with modern visuals, expanded gameplay systems, and a renewed focus on what made <i>CastleMiner Z</i> a fan favorite. Whether you're building epic fortresses or diving deep into the earth in search of rare ores, every game offers something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Next-Gen Visuals:</strong>\u00a0Rebuilt visuals powered by Unreal Engine 5, with real time raytraced lighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Survival Combat:</strong> Face waves of zombies and deadly dragons with an arsenal of  weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Worlds:</strong> Endless terrain, unique landscapes, and hidden secrets await in every new world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer:\u00a0</strong>Team up or go solo \u2014 build, survive, and dominate together in online co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Crafting and Building:</strong> Enhanced systems give you more tools, more options, and more freedom to create.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome back to the world where survival is just the beginning.<br>Welcome to <i>CastleMiner Z: Resurrection</i>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CastleMiner Z: Resurrection</strong><br>The cult hit returns, rebuilt from the ground up in Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CastleMiner Z: Resurrection</i> is the ultimate open-world sandbox survival shooter. Explore vast, procedurally generated worlds \u2014 from scorched deserts to frozen wastelands \u2014 as you mine, craft, build, and fight for your life against relentless undead and fire-breathing dragons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than a remaster. We've reimagined every biome, weapon, and enemy with modern visuals, expanded gameplay systems, and a renewed focus on what made <i>CastleMiner Z</i> a fan favorite. Whether you're building epic fortresses or diving deep into the earth in search of rare ores, every game offers something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Next-Gen Visuals:</strong>\u00a0Rebuilt visuals powered by Unreal Engine 5, with real time raytraced lighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Survival Combat:</strong> Face waves of zombies and deadly dragons with an arsenal of  weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Worlds:</strong> Endless terrain, unique landscapes, and hidden secrets await in every new world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer:\u00a0</strong>Team up or go solo \u2014 build, survive, and dominate together in online co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Crafting and Building:</strong> Enhanced systems give you more tools, more options, and more freedom to create.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome back to the world where survival is just the beginning.<br>Welcome to <i>CastleMiner Z: Resurrection</i>.</p>",
